  "releaseNotes": "v17.0.0 / v18.0.0: Initial release, shipped as two version lines — 17.x for Umbraco 17 and 18.x for Umbraco 18 — in lockstep with the core TextToSpeech package lines. Piper engine for uTPro.Feature.TextToSpeech: OS-aware binary resolution, voices discovered from the models folder, speed via length_scale, bounded run time, no shell interpolation.",
